     that number IS the real OS pid the kernel assigned this run, which
     varies seed-for-seed even with every input held fixed, and printing
     it would make this leaf's own output nondeterministic - exactly the
     "no clock/pid/address in output" rule this batch's surface brief
     states. Hand-caught this session: the campaign harness's own
