    a text called 'the decoded name' is 'gen buffer companion' of "specific exit".
    a text called 'the decoded line' is "a number called {'the decoded name'} is the reaped status divide 256 modulo 256".
    a text called 'the decoded assert' is 'gen assert number is' of "PRC-48" and 'the decoded name' and 'the exit code'.
    a number called 'the foreign pid' is 'rng below' of 900000 add 9000000.
