    a text called 'the foreign reap name' is 'gen buffer companion' of "foreign specific reap".
    a text called 'the foreign flag name' is 'gen buffer companion' of "foreign specific refused".
    a text called 'the foreign flag init' is "a boolean called {'the foreign flag name'} is false".
    a text called 'the foreign reap line' is "a number called {'the foreign reap name'} is {'the foreign reap expr'}".
