    a text called 'the foreign flag assert' is 'gen assert true' of "PRC-47" and 'the foreign flag name'.
    a list called 'the lines' is ['the child line', 'the child branch', 'the real reap line', 'the real matched init', 'the real matched set', 'the real match assert', 'the decoded line', 'the decoded assert', 'the foreign flag init', 'the foreign reap line', 'the foreign handler', 'the foreign negative assert', 'the foreign flag assert'].
